@startuml component_diagram

skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam defaultFontSize 13

left to right direction

package "TODO Application" {

    component "Entry Point\n(main)" as Main

    package "CLI Layer" {
        component "Interactive Menu" as IM
        component "Command-line Interface\n(TodoCLI)" as CLI
    }

    package "Service Layer" {
        component "Todo Service" as SVC
        component "Task Manager" as MGR
        component "Project Manager" as PMGR
        component "Comments Service" as CMT
        component "Import/Export Service" as IMPEXP
    }

    package "Domain Model" {
        component "Project Model\n(Project)" as ProjectModel
        component "Task Model\n(Task, TaskStatus)" as Model
        component "Comment Model\n(TaskComment)" as CommentModel
        component "Task Summary Report\n(TaskSummaryReport)" as SummaryModel
    }

    package "Utilities" {
        component "DateTime Utilities\n(DateTimeUtils)" as DTUtils
    }

    package "Persistence Layer" {
        component "JSON Storage\n(JsonStorage)" as Storage
        component "Project Storage\n(ProjectStorage)" as ProjectStore
    }
}

database "todo_data.json" as DB
database "todo_projects.json" as ProjectDB

Main --> IM : interactive mode
Main --> CLI : command mode

IM --> SVC
CLI --> SVC

SVC --> MGR
SVC --> PMGR
SVC --> CMT
SVC --> IMPEXP : export/import
SVC ..> SummaryModel : generates

IMPEXP --> MGR : read/write tasks
IMPEXP --> CMT : read/write comments

MGR --> Storage
MGR --> DTUtils : validate & filter dates
MGR ..> Model
PMGR --> ProjectStore
PMGR ..> ProjectModel

CMT --> Storage : persist comments
CMT --> MGR : validate tasks
CMT ..> CommentModel

Storage ..> Model
Storage ..> CommentModel
ProjectStore ..> ProjectModel
DTUtils --> Model : works with

Storage --> DB : read/write
ProjectStore --> ProjectDB : read/write

@enduml